ass an author-side review without the shell-specific gate ever running.\n.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/manual-testing-playbook/language-standards/shell-standards.md:4. `for p in references/shell/style-guide/overview-structure-and-naming.md references/shell/style-guide/variables-functions-and-output.md references/shell/quality-standards/overview-and-priority-blockers.md references/shell/quality-standards/validation-security-and-n.md references/shell/quick-reference/template-variables-and-loops.md references/shell/quick-reference/functions-strings-and-checklist.md; do test -e \".skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/$p\" && echo \"OK $p\" || echo \"MISS $p\"; done`\n---\n.\n..\n.claude\n.codex\n.cursor\n.devin\n.env.example\n.git\n.github\n.gitignore\n.hermes\n.mcp.json\n.npmrc\n.opencode\n.pi\n.skilled\n.utcp_config.json\nAGENTS.md\nCONTRIBUTING.md\nLICENSE\nopencode.json\nPUBLIC-RELEASE.md\nREADME.md\nREPO RULES.md\nrepo-rules\nSECURITY.md\nspecs\ntsconfig.pi.json\ntui.json\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w27ef8e22cd/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"fe7a6a","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
